EN:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Knock it off!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Get away from me {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}with those
bees! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}They're gonna sting me!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Vattene via!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Allontanati {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}con quelle api!
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Non voglio che mi pungano!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Yapma şunu!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
O arılarla birlikte benden {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}uzak
dur! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Beni sokacaklar!
